- I weigh 74kg.

343
00:15:08,850 --> 00:15:09,880
Similar to me.

344
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:11,150
Yes, so we're almost...

345
00:15:11,350 --> 00:15:13,850
- It's 140kg.
- Almost 145kg.

346
00:15:13,850 --> 00:15:14,850
(So smooth and comfortable)

347
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:22,130
Look at the motorcycles.

348
00:15:22,660 --> 00:15:24,830
They're all motorcycles.

349
00:15:25,230 --> 00:15:26,900
We're the only rickshaw here.

350
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,970
This is Vietnam.

351
00:15:33,970 --> 00:15:35,540
This is the real Vietnam.

352
00:15:36,570 --> 00:15:38,580
Into the heart of Vietnam.

353
00:15:40,610 --> 00:15:43,310
It's quiet around here because it's a palace.

354
00:15:47,850 --> 00:15:49,520
This place is really beautiful.

355
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:50,620
Look.

356
00:15:53,420 --> 00:15:54,560
They have strong national pride.

357
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:56,490
- The Vietnamese flag is everywhere.
- Right?

358
00:15:56,490 --> 00:15:57,960
There's a really big flag over there as well.

359
00:15:58,660 --> 00:16:00,060
Oh, how cool.

360
00:16:01,570 --> 00:16:04,740
(Something you always see in the beautiful scenery)

361
00:16:05,700 --> 00:16:07,100
