362
00:16:07,100 --> 00:16:08,510
(You can easily spot the Vietnamese flag in the streets of Vietnam.)

363
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:11,510
(Everyone hangs up the flag on major holidays. It's a spectacular sight.)

364
00:16:12,580 --> 00:16:13,810
(Korea and Vietnam are even alike in our strong national pride.)

365
00:16:13,810 --> 00:16:16,010
We're even similar in that we both have strong national pride.

366
00:16:16,010 --> 00:16:18,420
- We really are similar.
- Right?

367
00:16:19,980 --> 00:16:23,220
Vietnam also used to have a very prosperous dynasty.

368
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,920
Both Korea and Vietnam...

369
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:27,890
- We're similar.
- We went through a lot.

370
00:16:27,890 --> 00:16:29,060
We went through a lot.

371
00:16:30,090 --> 00:16:32,500
- It's Huế Palace. Isn't it pretty?
- Oh, my.

372
00:16:32,500 --> 00:16:34,200
How cool. Oh, my.

373
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:35,270
The palace is big.

374
00:16:35,270 --> 00:16:39,340
(The palace walls are starting to come into view.)

375
