379
00:16:52,450 --> 00:16:54,050
Isn't it so pretty?

380
00:16:54,050 --> 00:16:55,320
How old do you think this is?

381
00:17:05,830 --> 00:17:07,600
Okay. We're here.

382
00:17:07,600 --> 00:17:08,700
Thank you.

383
00:17:08,830 --> 00:17:10,130
Thank you very much.

384
00:17:11,570 --> 00:17:12,600
Okay.

385
00:17:13,770 --> 00:17:15,240
There are so many people.

386
00:17:16,540 --> 00:17:17,780
Oh, so many...

387
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,980
- There are so many.
- So many, right?

388
00:17:20,310 --> 00:17:24,250
