397
00:17:49,740 --> 00:17:50,770
Oh, no.

398
00:17:50,770 --> 00:17:52,810
(Emperor Bảo Đại, as told by AI)

399
00:17:53,380 --> 00:17:56,250
(Thinking of the sadness of the last king,)

400
00:18:01,690 --> 00:18:06,390
