401
00:18:06,390 --> 00:18:07,590
The last 100 years...

402
00:18:09,990 --> 00:18:13,530
(Their attempts to portray how powerless the king felt)

403
00:18:15,130 --> 00:18:16,230
Okay. Let's head inside.

404
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:22,210
