405
00:18:22,370 --> 00:18:24,480
- The gate into Gyeongbokgung?
- Gyeongbokgung, yes.

406
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:28,810
Oh, how cool.

407
00:18:29,710 --> 00:18:34,590
(Huế Palace, the imperial palace of the Nguyen Dynasty)

408
00:18:36,450 --> 00:18:38,760
- Oh, this place is so cool.
- Seriously.

409
00:18:39,160 --> 00:18:41,530
It's so cool. So vast.

410
00:18:41,530 --> 00:18:43,790
