- It's breathtaking.

411
00:18:43,790 --> 00:18:45,660
The last pride of the Vietnamese dynasty.

412
00:18:49,970 --> 00:18:52,340
For around 143 years, the Huế Imperial Palace...

413
00:18:52,740 --> 00:18:53,870
