414
00:18:53,870 --> 00:18:54,970
the last feudal dynasty of Vietnam.

415
00:18:55,140 --> 00:18:56,540
This is the place where the emperor lived...

416
00:18:56,540 --> 00:18:58,180
and ruled the country from.

417
00:18:58,180 --> 00:19:02,610
In 1993, it was named a UNESCO World Heritage Site.

418
00:19:03,180 --> 00:19:06,020
Huế Palace was greatly damaged during the French colonial period...

419
00:19:06,020 --> 00:19:07,850
and the Vietnam War.

420
00:19:07,990 --> 00:19:12,090
Restoration and repair work is still continuing to this day.

421
00:19:13,520 --> 00:19:14,590
Here, here.

422
00:19:14,590 --> 00:19:16,460
(The history of the Nguyen Dynasty...)

423
00:19:16,460 --> 00:19:18,200
