431
00:19:40,650 --> 00:19:41,750
I'm sure they do.

432
00:19:42,290 --> 00:19:43,950
You know about royal walkways from being in historical dramas.

433
00:19:43,950 --> 00:19:45,520
- Right.
- The paths kings walk on.

434
00:19:45,520 --> 00:19:47,490
(Royal walkway)

435
00:19:48,660 --> 00:19:49,930
(Royal walkway, the center of the three walkways...)

436
00:19:49,930 --> 00:19:51,230
(laid in front of the throne hall...)

437
00:19:51,230 --> 00:19:52,530
(that only the king could walk on)

438
00:19:52,530 --> 00:19:54,460
How would it feel to walk on this path...

439
00:19:54,460 --> 00:19:56,130
- as the king?
- Right?

440
00:19:58,200 --> 00:20:01,640
(Scene 2, The King's Road)

441
00:20:01,770 --> 00:20:04,840
(Today is a meaningful day when the king himself visited.)

442
00:20:06,610 --> 00:20:11,520
(Citizens have gathered to catch a glimpse of the king.)

443
00:20:13,080 --> 00:20:15,690
If you could be born again as a king, would you do it?

444
00:20:15,690 --> 00:20:16,720
I would.

445
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:18,190
I'm a pacifist, so no fighting.

446
00:20:18,190 --> 00:20:20,890
Instead of going down in history, you want to be a stable king.

447
00:20:20,890 --> 00:20:21,930
Exactly.

448
00:20:23,430 --> 00:20:25,500
(But not even the king could avoid the heat.)

449
00:20:25,500 --> 00:20:27,030
- It's so large.
- Oh, this is...

450
00:20:27,560 --> 00:20:28,970
I thought I'd die today.

451
00:20:29,630 --> 00:20:30,870
It is hot.

452
00:20:31,740 --> 00:20:33,970
I'm grateful to have this cart.

453
00:20:33,970 --> 00:20:35,040
Thank you.

454
00:20:36,210 --> 00:20:37,410
Hello.

455
00:20:37,410 --> 00:20:38,640
- Hello.
- Hello.

456
00:20:38,640 --> 00:20:40,680
- Who are you?
- I'm a guide.

457
00:20:40,680 --> 00:20:43,380
- Oh, a guide.
- I'm the guide...

458
00:20:43,380 --> 00:20:45,320
who'll take you two around today.

459
00:20:45,320 --> 00:20:46,720
You're good at Korean.

460
00:20:47,780 --> 00:20:51,490
(The palace looks even greener from the cart.)

461
00:20:52,160 --> 00:20:54,760
(Time for a tour of Huế Palace you can enjoy on a cart.)

462
00:20:55,060 --> 00:20:58,060
There are a total of three courses today.

463
00:20:58,060 --> 00:20:59,100
- Okay.
- Okay.

464
00:20:59,160 --> 00:21:01,630
