469
00:21:09,640 --> 00:21:14,510
(It serves the same purpose as Korea's Jongmyo Shrine.)

470
00:21:15,110 --> 00:21:17,810
Where they have altars for kings.

471
00:21:17,810 --> 00:21:20,680
(They still perform ancestral rites for the past emperors.)

472
00:21:23,050 --> 00:21:25,690
So this is Thế Tổ Miếu.

473
00:21:26,420 --> 00:21:29,060
It's so long. So it's not a tomb.

474
00:21:29,060 --> 00:21:30,190
It's a shrine.

475
00:21:30,530 --> 00:21:34,430
(Ancestral tablets of past emperors are reverently enshrined here.)

476
00:21:34,430 --> 00:21:36,270
- Oh, it's so cool. Look at that.
- Oh, my.

477
00:21:37,500 --> 00:21:38,840
Whenever there's a new dynasty,

478
00:21:38,840 --> 00:21:40,770
