479
00:21:40,840 --> 00:21:43,210
(Emperor Gia Long)

480
00:21:43,510 --> 00:21:45,510
(Emperor Hàm Nghi)

481
00:21:45,740 --> 00:21:47,840
(Emperor Thành Thái)

482
00:21:47,980 --> 00:21:49,210
Jongmyo Shrine is like this too.

483
00:21:50,080 --> 00:21:51,150
It's similar.

484
00:21:51,550 --> 00:21:55,150
(The ancestral tablets of kings and queens are stored in Jongmyo.)

485
00:21:56,250 --> 00:21:58,360
