517
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:21,870
(welcomed in travellers)

518
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:24,170
Emperor Khải Định's mom.

519
00:23:24,440 --> 00:23:25,580
I see.

520
00:23:26,080 --> 00:23:27,680
Like the grand queen dowager...

521
00:23:28,250 --> 00:23:30,450
- Real photos. How fascinating.
- They are real photos.

522
00:23:30,450 --> 00:23:33,180
